{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31427","headline":"九华山 · 郭夔","name":"九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩翠凌云出迥然，迢嶤万丈倚秋天。\n暮风飘送当轩色，晓雾斜飞入槛烟。\n帘卷倚屏双影聚，镜开朱户九条悬。\n画图何必家家有，自有画图来目前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}